❮ LinkedList Methods

ThereplaceAll()method replaces every item in a list with the result of performing an operation on the item. The operation can be defined by a lambda expression that is compatible with Java'sUnaryOperatorinterface.

To learn about lambda expressions, see ourJava Lambda Expression tutorial.

