### Code Examples

```
Example
Add 1 to every number in a list:
import java.util.LinkedList;

public class Main {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    LinkedList<Integer> numbers = new LinkedList<Integer>();
    numbers.add(5);
    numbers.add(9);
    numbers.add(8);
    numbers.add(6);
    numbers.add(1);
    numbers.replaceAll( n -> n + 1 );
    System.out.println(numbers);
  }
}
